### ERP + CRM Backend API Collection
### Import into Postman or use with VS Code REST Client extension
### Replace {{base_url}} and {{token}} as needed

@base_url = http://localhost:4000
@token = 

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### AUTH — Login & Register
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Login (get JWT token)
POST {{base_url}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "sales@erp.local",
  "password": "sales123"
}

### 2. Register new user (admin-only)
POST {{base_url}}/auth/register
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Sales Rep",
  "email": "newsales@erp.local",
  "password": "password123",
  "role": "SALES"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### CUSTOMERS
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 3. Create customer
POST {{base_url}}/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Retail Store",
  "mobile": "9876543210",
  "email": "newstore@retail.com",
  "businessName": "New Retail Store Ltd",
  "gstNumber": "27AABCU1234H1Z0",
  "customerType": "RETAIL",
  "address": "999 New Street, Mumbai",
  "status": "LEAD",
  "followUpDate": "2026-08-30T10:00:00Z"
}

### 4. List customers (with pagination)
GET {{base_url}}/customers?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 5. List customers with search
GET {{base_url}}/customers?search=ABC&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 6. List customers with filter by status
GET {{base_url}}/customers?status=ACTIVE&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 7. List customers with filter by type
GET {{base_url}}/customers?customerType=WHOLESALE&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 8. Get customer by ID
GET {{base_url}}/customers/CUSTOMER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 9. Update customer
PUT {{base_url}}/customers/CUSTOMER_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "ABC Retail Store Updated",
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### 10. Add note to customer
POST {{base_url}}/customers/CUSTOMER_ID_HERE/notes
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "Reached out, prefers bulk orders on Fridays"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### PRODUCTS & INVENTORY
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 11. Create product
POST {{base_url}}/products
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Industrial Component",
  "sku": "SKU-NEW-001",
  "category": "Components",
  "unitPrice": 2500,
  "currentStock": 30,
  "minStockAlert": 10,
  "warehouseLocation": "Rack E5"
}

### 12. List products (with pagination)
GET {{base_url}}/products?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 13. List products with search by name
GET {{base_url}}/products?search=Bearing&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 14. List products with search by SKU
GET {{base_url}}/products?search=SKU-001&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 15. List products with filter by category
GET {{base_url}}/products?category=Bearings&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 16. Get product by ID
GET {{base_url}}/products/PRODUCT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 17. Update product
PUT {{base_url}}/products/PRODUCT_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Industrial Bearing Type A Updated",
  "unitPrice": 1600,
  "minStockAlert": 15
}

### 18. Get stock movement history for product
GET {{base_url}}/products/PRODUCT_ID_HERE/stock-log?page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 19. Manual stock adjustment - Add stock (IN)
POST {{base_url}}/products/PRODUCT_ID_HERE/stock-adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 25,
  "movementType": "IN",
  "reason": "Purchase order PO-2026-001 received"
}

### 20. Manual stock adjustment - Remove stock (OUT)
POST {{base_url}}/products/PRODUCT_ID_HERE/stock-adjust
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 5,
  "movementType": "OUT",
  "reason": "Damage/waste write-off"
}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### CHALLANS (Sales Orders) — Core Business Logic
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 21. Create DRAFT challan (no stock deduction)
POST {{base_url}}/challans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUSTOMER_ID_HERE",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_ID_1",
      "quantity": 5
    },
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_ID_2",
      "quantity": 10
    }
  ],
  "status": "DRAFT"
}

### 22. Create CONFIRMED challan (validates stock, deducts atomically)
POST {{base_url}}/challans
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "CUSTOMER_ID_HERE",
  "items": [
    {
      "productId": "PRODUCT_ID_HERE",
      "quantity": 3
    }
  ],
  "status": "CONFIRMED"
}

### 23. List challans (paginated)
GET {{base_url}}/challans?page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 24. List challans filtered by status
GET {{base_url}}/challans?status=CONFIRMED&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 25. List challans filtered by customer
GET {{base_url}}/challans?customerId=CUSTOMER_ID_HERE&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 26. List challans filtered by date range
GET {{base_url}}/challans?startDate=2026-08-01T00:00:00Z&endDate=2026-08-31T23:59:59Z&page=1&limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 27. Get challan by ID (with items)
GET {{base_url}}/challans/CHALLAN_ID_HERE
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 28. Confirm DRAFT challan (validates stock, deducts atomically)
PUT {{base_url}}/challans/CHALLAN_ID_HERE/confirm
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 29. Cancel challan (restores stock if was CONFIRMED)
PUT {{base_url}}/challans/CHALLAN_ID_HERE/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
### HEALTH CHECK
### ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 30. Health check (no auth required)
GET {{base_url}}/health
